  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Promoting plastic circular economy in Nigeria</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This action intends to develop enabling environment to nurture circular economy practices in industry along with plastic value chains in Nigeria. It is expected that circular economy principles and practices are integrated into necessary policy and regulations so that effective implementation of sustainable plastic life cycle management, including the Extended Producer Responsibility (EPR) scheme, is ensured in industry along with (single use) plastic value chains.</narrative>
  </description>
